🔍 Troubleshooting & Configuration
Empty Dashboard / No Packets: Verify that the tool is listening on the correct network interface (e.g., Wi-Fi or Ethernet). If you are running virtual network adapters (WSL, VMware, VirtualBox) or a active VPN, ensure the script is targeting your primary host interface.
